This directory contains a narrow source copy of the rcc_preprocess crate
from https://github.com/noname0310/rcc at
aa7ba4115a986cd533965ae297de6490315c35cb, originally
licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0 according to its Cargo.toml.

Only this preprocessing crate is copied; lexer, session, source maps and other
rcc dependencies remain pinned at the original upstream commit.

Mini-C patches src/expand.rs to track macro invocation location separately
from the spelling span through token substitution, rescanning and builtins.
The original spelling spans must remain untouched so #/## keep their C99
semantics. See docs/Internal_CPP_Prototype.md and issue #12.

Do not replace this copy with upstream blindly: run the direct/macro-wrapped
__LINE__/__FILE__, #line and GCC/Clang differential suite first.
